  "title": "HB 1871 (2026 Second Regular Session (103rd General Assembly)): SENATE SUBSTITUTE FOR SENATE COMMITTEE SUBSTITUTE FOR HOUSE COMMITTEE SUBSTITUTE FOR HOUSE BILL NO. 1871: An Act to repeal sections 105.465, 108.240, 115.125, 115.127, 115.133, 115.233, 115.277, 115.284, 115.306, 115.427, 115.430, 115.453, 115.637, 115.646, 130.031, and 130.034, RSMo, and to enact in lieu thereof seventeen new sections relating to elections, with penalty provisions and a severability clause.",
